<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it upgraded USA Detergents Inc to buy from hold, saying the stock's selloff was &quot;overdone.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday the company said it expected its fourth-quarter revenues and profits to fall short of analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Thursday off 13-7/8 to 20-3/8.</p>
</text>
